, fixture, API, model, search, and web content as untrusted. Keep execution secretless unless the protected F15 workflow supplies an approved environment identity. Never place credentials or private Azure identifiers in public artifacts.\n\n## Budget and TTL impact\n\n- **Azure estimate delta:** none; no provisioning authorized\n- **Actions estimate:** <= 15 minutes\n- **Copilot request estimate:** 1 coding-agent session plus bounded review\n- **Live TTL impact:** none\n- **If a ceiling is reached:** stop; do not weaken policy; trigger scoped cleanup if owned resources exist.\n\n## Rollback and cleanup\n\nRevert only this bounded PR. No Azure resources are authorized by this issue.\n\n## Prohibited actions\n\n- Do not merge, self-approve, mark ready, bypass rules, deploy production, change visibility/settings, or access credentials.\n- Do not modify paths outside Owned paths.\n- Do not use `gh stack merge` or rewrite branches.\n- Do not broaden cleanup or fabricate test/evidence results.\n\n## Worker handoff\n\n- Open one draft PR linked only to this issue.\n- Report changed paths, commands and real results, assumptions, blockers, and artifacts.\n- Stop on ambiguity, stale state, path conflict, missing capability, failed required check, or budget/TTL risk.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/18/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/18/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/14","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/14/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos