ab/pull/23.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-23T03:35:40Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n- stop intake from running on every label transition\n- keep intake validation on newly opened and edited proposals\n- regenerate the intake lock with gh-aw v0.86.2\n- include compiler-managed action metadata\n\n## Why\n\nThe live F0 run proved that reacting to `factory:ready` can add a competing state label. That violates the exactly-one-state invariant and makes dispatch ambiguous.\n\n## Validation\n\n- gh-aw compiled the intake source with zero errors and warnings\n- generated lock-file changes came from the Markdown source\n- scope is limited to the approved factory-control issue\n\nCloses #22\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/23/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/23/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4","id":5224871054,"node_id":"I_kwDOUA_pQM8AAAABN200jg","number":4,"title":"[AF-20260823-full] Complete AIMarket Factory F0-F15 proof","user":{"login":"DanWahlin","id":1767249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjcyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1767249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanWahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/DanWahlin","fo