om/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/discussions/3\n- **Product contract version/SHA:** `02cc0a16c86091ae4ca139c2ce186b9dcc940eb0`\n- **Factory policy version:** `v1`\n- **Target public repository:** `DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab`\n- **Owner:** `DanWahlin`\n- **Repository visibility verified public:** `YES`\n- **Run start:** `2026-08-23T01:58:57Z`\n- **Azure live TTL:** starts only when F15 provisioning begins and must remain `<= 4h`\n\n## Goals and non-goals\n\n### Goals\n\n- Exercise every canonical work order F0–F15 without skipping or merging IDs.\n- Prove Copilot coding-agent dispatch, draft PRs, independent review, protected merges, live Azure conformance, teardown, and evidence read-back.\n\n### Non-goals\n\n- Production deployment.\n- Automatic merge, approval, or branch-rule bypass.\n- Reuse of the earlier manually deployed AIMarket implementation as factory evidence.\n\n## Capability decision\n\n| Capability | Proof | Decision | Fallback/stop condition |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Public Discussions | RFC #3 created and readable | Proceed | Stop if read-back fails |\n| Copilot coding agent | Tokenless gh-aw review workflow passed | Proceed | Stop if coding-agent session can't be created |\n| Chained-base PR + gh-stack API | `gh stack` installed; validate each live stack | Proceed | Stop on ambiguous base/retarget failure |\n| Projects v2 | Project and fields created/read back | Proceed | Issues remain authoritative |\n| Mandatory staging reviewer | Four public-repository environments each have one reviewer | Proceed | Stop rather than bypass approval |\n| Azure OIDC/RG scope | Must be proven by F11/F13 before provisioning | Pending | Factual BLOCKED if narrow identity isn't available |\n\n## Budget and TTL\n\n| Budget | Requested | Policy ceiling |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Azure estimate (USD) | <= 20 | 20 |\n| Actions minutes | <= 240 | 240 |\n| Copilot premium requests | <= 40 | 40 |\n| Azure live TTL | <= 4h | 4h |\n\nCrossing a ceiling stops new dispatch/provisioning and triggers scoped cleanup if resources exist.\n\n## Child work orders\n\nThe canonical graph is `factory/task-graph.yml`. Child issue links will be added after creation.\n\n## Human approvals\n\n- [x] RFC approved by Dan's explicit request to run the complete journey.\n- [ ] Each readiness label is applied only after dependency and WIP read-back.\n- [ ] Every merge receives final-head deterministic checks and independent review.\n- [ ] Protected staging is approved for the exact F15 SHA.\n- [ ] Cleanup and prerelease evidence are read back.\n\n## Prohibited actions\n\n- No production scope, automatic merge, self-approval, rules bypass, visibility change, broad cleanup, or agent credential access.\n- No secrets or private Azure identifiers in public artifacts.\n- No mutation of unrelated repository or Azure resources.\n\n## Completion checklist\n\n- [ ] F0–F15 are terminal with exactly one state label each.\n- [ ] Every merged implementation PR passed the canonical checks on its final SHA.\n- [ ] One protected staging run passed or recorded a factual platform blocker.\n- [ ] Cleanup proved zero owned active/soft-deleted resources and preserved unrelated resources.\n- [ ] Evidence hashes, actual budgets, prerelease, and retrospective are published.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/21","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanWahlin/aimarket-factory-journey-lab/issues/21/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.githu