_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10897423376,"node_id":"LA_kwDOKDzNHs8AAAACiYl8EA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/labels/cla-signed","name":"cla-signed","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-31T14:54:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pulls/217","html_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217","diff_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\nAdds two related SDKs for [AIMarket Protocol v2](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-protocol) — federated discovery, HTTP 402 payment channels, safety-gated invoke, and settlement with signed receipts.\n\n| Project | Role |\n|---------|------|\n| [aimarket-agent](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-agent) | Python SDK + CLI (`pip install aimarket-agent`) |\n| [aimarket-sdks](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-sdks) | Dart (alpha), TypeScript/Rust clients |\n\nReference hub: https://modelmarket.dev\n\n## Why this list\nThese are client libraries for building autonomous agents that discover and pay for capabilities across a federation — aligned with “SDKs for creating and deploying AI agents.”\n\nNot affiliated with e2b; independent open-source (MIT).","reactions":