n/Library/Application Support/Cursor/clp/3bfb7f1471a52e527cfc1587dd57c7c1.zh-cn/corrupted.info\"}'\nVSCODE_PID=415\nVSCODE_PROCESS_TITLE='extension-host  aimarket [2-2]'\nXPC_FLAGS=0x0\nXPC_SERVICE_NAME=application.com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92.44482246.44482252\nYARN_CACHE_FOLDER=/var/folders/5y/psjxn57j0yd07lrg5y3yhjp40000gn/T/cursor-sandbox-cache/42349739287a07a57fed17444d5b01c4/yarn\n_ZO_DOCTOR=0\n__CFBundleIdentifier=com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92\n__CF_USER_TEXT_ENCODING=0x1F5:0x19:0x34\nnpm_config_devdir=/var/folders/5y/psjxn57j0yd07lrg5y3yhjp40000gn/T/cursor-sandbox-cache/42349739287a07a57fed17444d5b01c4/node-gyp 环境变量后 \n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Deploy 全绿\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/139/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/105","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/105/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/105/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/105/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/105","id":4562593933,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSmkpxc7hVcU6","number":105,"title":"feat(agent): P3.1 Checkpointer 与 API 重启续跑","user":{"login":"sev7n4","id":130808187,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8v5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130808187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-01T11:12:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T12:40:53Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T12:40:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/pulls/105","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/105","diff_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/105.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/105.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-01T12:40:53Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n- **Sqlite checkpointer**：`AGENT_CHECKPOINTER=sqlite` 时使用 `@langchain/langgraph-checkpoint-sqlite`（需 `better-sqlite3` 构建）；失败回退 memory。\n- **DB fallback**：`resumeAgentRunFromDb` — API 重启后 Memory/Sqlite checkpoint 丢失 interrupt 时，用 `agent_runs` + `state_json` 合并 Job 结果并推进下一步（含 VLM observe 重试逻辑）。\n- **Runner 重构**：`graph-instance` + 启动时 `initAgentCheckpointer()`；`rowToInitialState` 恢复 `observations` / `stepRetries`。\n\n## 配置\n\n```bash\nAGENT_CHECKPOINTER=memory   # 默认\n# AGENT_CHECKPOINTER=sqlite\n# AGENT_CHECKPOINT_SQLITE_PATH=./data/agent-checkpoints.sqlite\n```\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm --filter @aimarket/agent-core build`\n- [x] `pnpm --filter @aimarket/api typecheck`\n- [ ] CI + Integration + E2E\n- [ ] 本地：创建 Agent Run → 重启 API → 待 Job 完成后应仍能 `completed`（DB fallback）\n\n## 后续\n\n- P3.2：Redis checkpointer（多实例）、Skill 步骤 VLM 选 hero\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/105/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/104","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/104/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/104/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/104/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/104","id":4562224549,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSmkpxc7hUPMr","number":104,"title":"feat(agent): P3 VLM observe 与步骤质检重试","user":{"login":"sev7n4","id":130808187,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8v5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130808187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-01T10:12:11Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T10:22:13Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T10:22:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/pulls/104","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/104","diff_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/104.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/104.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-01T10:22:13Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n- **VLM Provider**（`apps/api/src/providers/vlm`）：`mock` + 可选 `qwen-vl`（DashScope 多模态）；`AGENT_VLM_ENABLED=true` 时生效。\n- **LangGraph `observe` 节点**：调用 `observeAgentStep`；质检失败且未超重试上限 → 回到 `execute_step` 重跑当前步；否则 `advance`。\n- **Runner**：注入 `observeStep` / `maxStepRetries`；`state_json` 持久化 `stepRetries`。\n- 文档：P2.6 ✅；P3 进行中；P3.1 预留 Redis checkpointer。\n\n## 配置\n\n```bash\nAGENT_VLM_ENABLED=true\nAGENT_VLM_PROVIDER=auto   # mock | qwen\nAGENT_VLM_MAX_STEP_RETRIES=1\n# Claude：AGENT_LLM_ALLOW_OVERSEAS=true 且 FALLBACKS 含 claude（已有 router）\n```\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm --filter @aimarket/agent-core build`\n- [x] `pnpm --filter @aimarket/api typecheck`\n- [ ] CI + Integration + E2E\n- [ ] 本地开启 VLM 后跑多步 Agent Run，观察失败重试（可用 `AGENT_VLM_MOCK_FAIL_ONCE=true`）\n\n## 后续（未在本 PR）\n\n- P3.1：Redis / SQLite LangGraph checkpointer\n- Skill 步骤 VLM 选 hero（可复用 `runVlmQualityCheck`）\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/104/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/103","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/103/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/103/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/103/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/103","id":4562073605,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSmkpxc7hTxtC","number":103,"title":"feat(agent): P2.6 Skill Job 完成事件驱动续跑","user":{"login":"sev7n4","id":130808187,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8v5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130808187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-01T09:49:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T09:59:25Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T09:59:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/pulls/103","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/103","diff_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/103.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/103.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-01T09:59:25Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n- `executeSkillRun` / `startSkillRunStep` 只创建当前步 Job 并置为 `waiting_job`，不再在 API 进程内 `waitForJob` 轮询。\n- `notifyAgentJobCompleted` 增加 `resumeSkillRunOnJobCompleted`，在 Job 成功/失败后合并输出并启动下一步或标记 `completed`/`failed`。\n- 抽出 `job-observation.ts`，避免 `job-events` ↔ `skill-executor` 循环依赖。\n- 文档：P2.5 标 ✅，新增 P2.6 阶段说明。\n\n## 为何现在做\n\n#102 合并后 Skill 已可端到端跑通；本 PR 为 Inngest worker 与非阻塞 API 打基础（worker 不必占住连接等 3 步全部完成）。\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm --filter @aimarket/api typecheck`\n- [x] 本地 `node scripts/test-agent-skill.mjs` — 6/6\n- [ ] CI + Integration + E2E\n\n## 后续\n\n- **P3**：VLM 质检 observe、Redis checkpointer、Claude fallback\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/99","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/99/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/99/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/99/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/99","id":4561526373,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSmkpxc7hR_zV","number":99,"title":"feat(web): 创作台接入 Agent Run 编排 (P1.5)","user":{"login":"sev7n4","id":130808187,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8v5ew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130808187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sev7n4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-01T08:23:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T08:34:01Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T08:34:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/pulls/99","html_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/99","diff_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/99.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/pull/99.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-01T08:34:01Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n- 新增 `AgentRunPanel` + `useAgentRun`：计划预览（debounce `/agent/plan`）、Run 状态轮询、步骤高亮。\n- Studio 创作台 `CreationPanel` 启用 `agentOrchestration`：提交创建 `/agent/runs`，待确认时展示「确认执行」，Job 通过现有 SSE 联动。\n- API Client：`createAgentRun` / `fetchAgentRun` / `confirmAgentRun` / `cancelAgentRun`。\n- 圈选工具、焦点编辑、视频模型仍走原有直接提交路径。\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm --filter @aimarket/web typecheck`\n- [ ] Studio：输入 prompt 见 Agent 计划预览\n- [ ] 提交后多步任务进度与画布刷新\n- [ ] 高积分计划出现「确认执行」流程\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/99/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sev7n4/aimarket/issues/99/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdcllc/AI-Driven-Dev-Env/issues/28","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdcllc/AI-Driven-Dev-Env","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdcllc/AI-Driven-Dev-Env/issues/28/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdcllc/AI-Driven-Dev-Env/issues/28/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kdcllc/AI-Driven-Dev-Env/issues/28/events","html_url":"https://github.com/kdcllc/AI-Driven-Dev-Env/pu